 scenic route,</strong> enjoying the freedom of the road and the most beautiful places.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve new puzzles</strong> and play exciting mini-games while collecting unique souvenirs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet a funny raccoon</strong> in bonus locations \u2013 he knows where the most interesting finds are hidden!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097080/extras/aa4388b5c73c46f33ee97abdd129bc4b.poster.avif?t=1772655986\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097080/extras/aa4388b5c73c46f33ee97abdd129bc4b.webm?t=1772655986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097080/extras/aa4388b5c73c46f33ee97abdd129bc4b.mp4?t=1772655986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collector's Edition \u2014 Even More Coziness and Adventure!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10 additional locations</strong> \u2014 find even more hidden objects and meet a funny raccoon!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8 new mini-games + 12 additional puzzles</strong> \u2014 a real challenge for logic lovers!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A collection of unique souvenirs</strong> \u2014 20 exclusive memorabilia from your trip!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beautiful wallpapers and a music player</strong> \u2014 decorate your desktop with magnificent landscapes and listen to atmospheric tracks on the road!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready for a new dream road trip? Start your engine \u2013 ahead lie endless landscapes, warm memories, and the spirit of true adventure!</p>","developers":["Avi Games"],"genres":[{